# Set-up
This R markdown document contains the code for the pre-processing of bulk RNA-sequencing files, including expression matrices and metadata, for Brain Integrative Transcriptome Hub (BITHub) web resource. All datasets were retrieved as described in Table 1 in the GitHub Repository. 

In order to re-run the scripts, please make sure to change the location of input files. All directories are defined in `code/preprocess/raw_file_locations.R`. 

A copy of each processed metadata will also be saved in 'output/metadata/` for plotting purposes. 

All other files are stored within the data folder of this R workflow directory. 

